# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Supabase connection (optional)
#
# The app ships with a working built-in project, so a deployment needs NO
# environment variables at all. Set these only to point a build at another
# Supabase project.
#
# If you do set them:
#   • copy the value exactly — no quotes, no trailing newline (Vercel's editor
#     happily keeps both, and either one makes PostgREST answer
#     "Invalid API key").
#   • the key may be the legacy `anon` JWT **or** a `sb_publishable_…` key.
#   • after changing a value you must redeploy; Vite bakes it into the bundle.
#
# A blank or malformed value is ignored at boot, and a key the gateway rejects
# is replaced by the built-in one automatically — the app shows a configuration
# card rather than a raw English error.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://pjrzncnhhlfaxuvlcdse.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJzdXBhYmFzZSIsInJlZiI6InBqcnpuY25oaGxmYXh1dmxjZHNlIiwicm9sZSI6ImFub24iLCJpYXQiOjE3OTMyMDAwNjksImV4cCI6MjEwODc3NjA2OX0.oPP4UNDdVEzZbRNyTsjNAX3cVc2EzOwIi8LS2y8nfNA
